 "statement": {
  "status": "present",
  "value": "base lists the elevations of n points, snow is a list of D days each giving the new snow at every point, and melt is a non-negative integer. On each day d, every point first gains snow[d][i] units, then loses min(melt, its accumulated snow) units. After day d the height of point i is base[i] plus its accumulated snow. Return a list of D integers: entry d is the total ascent of walking from point 0 to point n - 1 after day d, the sum over i of max(0, height[i + 1] - height[i]).",
  "provenance": [
